# Per-client Caddy site blocks are generated + written by
# scripts/register-caddy-client.sh directly on the production host over
# SSH (Task 4.4) — deliberately never committed. See the Caddyfile's own
# comment above the `import clients/*.caddy` line for why.
#
# That script itself is fleet-branch feature work and does not exist on
# this branch (abood is bug-fixes-only). This directory and the Caddyfile
# import line are carried here only as a disclosed exception so a
# disaster-recovery restore of /opt/qubix from abood doesn't silently lose
# the bootstrap the fleet automation depends on — see CLAUDE.md's Deploy
# discipline section.
*.caddy
!.gitignore
